name: card_common_point
description: "Common point of purchase - each card with card-not-present fraud linked to every merchant it paid at in the 45 days before (via = days before the fraud). Look for the one merchant most of the defrauded cards passed through in the same few weeks. A busy supermarket that hundreds of cards use is not here at all: none of its customers was defrauded."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: card_links_dataset
    sourceCol: src
    targetCol: dst
    linkKindCol: kind
    attrCols[3]: ts,amount,via
  filter:
    kind: group
    op: OR
    items[1]{kind,field,operator,value}:
      condition,kind,"=","visited_before_fraud"
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
